      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2017 The Authors. Published by WILEY-VCH Verlag GmbH & Co. KGaA, Weinheim.",
        "AbstractText": "A method for the production of complex cell-laden structures is reported, which allows high-levels of spatial control over mechanical and chemical properties. The potential of this method for producing complicated tissues is demonstrated by manufacturing a complex hard/soft tissue interface and demonstrating that cell phenotype can be maintained over four weeks of culture."
